Package: processdiagram
Type: Package
Title: Publication-Quality Path Diagrams for PROCESS-Style Mediation Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = c("Jason", "D."), family = "Freeman",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jason@jasondfreeman.com")
Description: Creates publication-quality path diagrams and manuscript-ready figure
    notes for supported PROCESS-style mediation models. It can wrap a user-supplied
    PROCESS function, preserve an explicit bootstrap seed, validate supported path
    structures against an independent native engine, import compatible PROCESS save=2
    results without rerunning the analysis, and export vector or high-resolution
    figures. Initial support includes Models 4, 6, and 81 and custom lower-triangular
    b-matrix specifications. This package is independent software and does not
    contain or redistribute PROCESS source code. Compatible wrapper parsing supports
    PROCESS for R 4.1 and 5.0 for the supported mediation structures.
URL: https://github.com/freejas/processdiagram
BugReports: https://github.com/freejas/processdiagram/issues
